#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example shows an E-Class SUV with three added payloads: one each representing the front and rear outriggers, and the third representing a roof load.
#
#The payload datasets for the outriggers determine the locations of the payloads with respect to the vehicle's sprung mass coordinate system origin, as well as their mass and inertia properties.
#
#See the Custom forces dataset, linked below, for more information on how four vertical forces are used to model the contact between outrigger wheels and the ground.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

